        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural stone plate, grounded, market mix, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural stone plate, grounded, market mix, at regional storage
pipeline transport is modelled as freight train transport.;
UUID: fb29e453-b2ca-3e20-8d45-55dbb04527a9
This data set accounts for 1 kg of natrural stone plate, grounded, at the regional storage. 87% are from import, 13% are produced in Switzerland. The imported goods are delivered to Siwtzerland to 51% over Italy, 15% from France, 7% from Germany, 10% from Turkey, 5 % from Spain etc.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: undefined
Time period: undefined
Production volume: CH consumption of natural stone: 634 kt (import and domestic production)
Sampling: statistical data 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_fb29e453-b2ca-3e20-8d45-55dbb04527a9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
